			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Navia"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401890301,
					"content": "Let me get a few other things in order first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890302,
					"content": "No problem. We'll be ready when you are!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4018904,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4018901
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4018901",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4018901,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Navia"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401890429,
					"content": "Let's do this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890401
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890401,
					"content": "It's time, dear partner and Paimon, for us to turn our attention to the Chevalmarin Film Fantasyland...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890402,
					"content": "As I mentioned, the park was started up by enthusiasts, who brought in the Spina di Rosula to handle the planning, construction, and operations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890403,
					"content": "Of course, enthusiasts aren't typically all-around experts. They usually stick to designing the event booths.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890404,
					"content": "We, for our part, handle long-term operations and develop standardized strategy guides for the different activities.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890405,
					"content": "Long-term operations, strategy... It all sounds so complicated!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890406,
					"content": "We spend most of our time adventuring, and we barely have any experience running a stall... Do you think we can handle this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890407,
						401890408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890407,
					"content": "Not every big boss went to business school, y'know!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890409,
					"content": "That's more like it! You've seen it all before, haven't you, partner? I'd even go as far as to say you've shaped some of Teyvat's biggest business ventures!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890410,
					"content": "Anyway! First things first, let's get an overview of how the whole festival's gonna be run...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890411,
					"content": "#Ah, Paimon thinks she just about gets it. How do you feel about it, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890412,
						401890413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890412,
					"content": "Haha, sounds right up my alley!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890414,
					"content": "Yep! C'mon, we can do this!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890415,
					"content": "Um, you mentioned \"standardized strategy guides\" just now... Does that mean there are non-standard ways to take part too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890416,
					"content": "Of course! Film and entertainment mean different things to different people, and there's gonna be a wide range of exciting activities for people to try out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890417,
					"content": "If we're not careful, some visitors might wander off and end up getting in trouble...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890418,
					"content": "And others might pick up dangerous props by mistake.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890419,
					"content": "To avoid confusion, we need to create a \"standardized strategy guide\" for each activity. Just think of it like a walkthrough!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890420,
						401890421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890420,
					"content": "I see, you want me to be your test player.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890422
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890422,
					"content": "Wow, if we're the first ones to test out the activities, who knows what surprises there could be waiting for us...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890423,
					"content": "But if we hit a tough spot, we'll just have to rely on our skills to carry us through!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890424,
					"content": "Hopefully it goes without saying that I'd never put you in danger, partner. I carefully checked all the existing activities before you arrived, and I can assure you that they're all perfectly safe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890425,
					"content": "I also wanted you to experience the activities before anyone else gets to. It'll be fun! Plus, we'd like to hear your thoughts and suggestions!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890426,
					"content": "Hehe, those are two things Navia is best at — making people feel safe, and having fun!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890427,
					"content": "Great. Well, I can't wait to hear what you think! Your input is super important to us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890428,
					"content": "Alright then, let's start with Eclectic Escapades and put our first guide together!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890421,
					"content": "I get it, you want me to set the benchmark.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890422
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890413,
					"content": "Wow... Guess we'll learn on the job!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890408,
					"content": "We've done plenty of big business ourselves!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890409
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4018905,
