							3936.542
						],
						"pointId": 340200187
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401890601,
					"content": "Both of you seem even more excited than before. Looks like your first trial run didn't disappoint!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890602,
						401890603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890602,
					"content": "The challenge format is super easy to get into!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890604,
					"content": "Paimon hasn't actually watched that many films, but after trying it out... she might just be hooked! We should check out the film that it's based on!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890605,
					"content": "Great job, Paimon! That's exactly what our enthusiast friends were hoping you'd say.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890606,
					"content": "They'd be beyond delighted to hear that visitors are curious about the films that inspired these attractions!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890607,
					"content": "Some have even been willing to contribute extra funds out of their own pockets — where budgets have allowed, of course.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890608,
					"content": "Out of their own pockets...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890609,
					"content": "That's right! While the Spina di Rosula covers the cost of basic booth materials and rental fees, many fans have personally funded promotional materials and related merchandise.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890610,
					"content": "The cost of the booth itself isn't their main expense. Some of them have already started designing spin-off products inspired by film characters.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890611,
					"content": "Take our official mascot, Surintendante Chevalmarin, for instance. She won second place in the last \"Most Popular Character\" poll for the comic film category, and was even dubbed \"the pinnacle of round, bouncy cuteness.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890612,
					"content": "Many people have expressed interest in designing cushions based on her image, using the highest quality fabrics and hiring the most skilled artisans to mass-produce them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890613,
					"content": "These cushions will officially go on sale at the next convention alongside lots of similar products!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890614,
						401890616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890614,
					"content": "Now that you mention it, I kinda want one too...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890615,
					"content": "Sounds irresistible, right? Plus, as Surintendante Chevalmarin's guardian and official image rights agent, Furina will receive sixty percent of the sales revenue!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890618,
					"content": "After all, the fans are doing this voluntarily — not for profit, but to promote Surintendante Chevalmarin's adorable image.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890619,
					"content": "The more Mora that ends up in Furina's purse, the better Surintendante Chevalmarin's meals will be — and who wouldn't be happy to hear that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890620,
					"content": "Hehe, Paimon likes the sound of that! Everyone working hard for something they all love, without worrying about profit!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890621,
					"content": "Still, we can't just ignore Mora completely. Whether it's fan creations or official commercial projects, some level of financial balance is still necessary.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890622,
					"content": "The same logic applies to the Chevalmarin Film Fantasyland taken as a whole.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890623,
					"content": "Once we've finished the standardized strategy guides, our attractions can officially be opened to the public. But we can't take personal charge of the ticketing process.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890624,
					"content": "There's plenty of work to do at the various booths, and the park itself is a work in progress. We'll need to assign dedicated employees to maintain and manage each attraction...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890625,
					"content": "There's a recruitment section on the park's bulletin board. We've received many applications, and each candidate has their strengths. Our job is to match the best candidates to each attraction based on their overall performance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890626,
					"content": "Once assigned, the staff will keep the attractions running, ensuring a continuous revenue stream!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890627,
					"content": "Wait, so we've suddenly gone from being playtesters to... Heads of Human Resources? That's definitely a first for us...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890628,
						401890629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890628,
					"content": "I have very high standards when it comes to reviewing resumes!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890630,
					"content": "Just don't hold everyone up to your own standards, okay? You can't expect everyone else to be as capable as you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890631,
					"content": "Alright, time to review some resumes! Fingers crossed, we'll get some exceptional candidates!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890629,
					"content": "I'll make an awesome boss.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890630
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890616,
					"content": "Shouldn't Furina be getting a sizable cut?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890617
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401890617,
					"content": "Don't worry, as Surintendante Chevalmarin's guardian and official image rights agent, Furina's already getting sixty percent of the sales revenue!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401890603,
					"content": "And it ties in perfectly with the film theme.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401890604
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4018907,
