			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401891401,
					"content": "I've refined the sauce for these Barbeque Ribs. It's a richer flavor than the classic version, but not at all greasy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891402,
					"content": "The Mint extract in the seasoning leaves a refreshing aftertaste — perfect for indulging yourself after a fun-filled day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891403,
					"content": "But if you ask me, I'd say the artisans need these more than the guests.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891404,
					"content": "The artisans?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891405,
					"content": "As I'm sure you've noticed, this park isn't quite finished. A serving of these Barbeque Ribs should help the artisans replenish their strength much more quickly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891406,
					"content": "As their bosses, you have an obligation to provide meals for them. So why not invite them to dine here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891407,
					"content": "Who knows, the morale boost might even improve their productivity.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891408,
					"content": "Oh? If I recall correctly, you once served up some special Fish and Chips for the porters over at the Fleuve Cendre...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891409,
					"content": "For several days after, the workers were all incredibly efficient. They'd finish eight hours of work in just five, and then because they clocked out early, they'd come back completely refreshed the next day.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891410,
					"content": "Then there's no time to lose. Go invite the artisans over while these ribs are still hot. I'll prepare some side dishes and desserts too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Escoffier"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891411,
					"content": "That's a great idea! You really live up to your reputation, Escoffier!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891412,
					"content": "Looks like these theme dishes are gonna make a huge difference after all! We'll have to make sure we check in with you regularly!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401891413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 401891413,
					"content": "You and Navia invite the artisans over, treating them to a delicious feast of special Barbeque Ribs...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
